# switch lowers to a compare chain (bne for the case, bcs to split the
# range) — no jump table anywhere.
absent jmp \(
absent jmp \[
in test_simple_switch: present cmp\.w #1\n\tbne \+\n\tjmp @switch_case
# Fall-through cases 0/1/2 share ONE body: case labels stacked on it (two
# since 2026-10-08, the third reaches it by a jump: `jnz (x == 0)` became
# `jnz x` with its targets swapped, which moved one block in the layout).
in test_fallthrough: present @switch_case\.\d+:\n@switch_case\.\d+:\n\tsep #\$20\n\tlda #100
in test_fallthrough: absent lda #100[\s\S]*lda #100
# Sparse 16-bit values are compared directly (no table for 0x1000).
in test_sparse_values: present cmp\.w #4096
# A switch without default emits no default block.
in test_no_default: absent @switch_default
